Description:
A Python library for generating and parsing macOS Alias records. This dependency
is required by for programmatic creation of macOS DMG installer .DS_Store files.

Local Modifications:
Added mac_alias.dist-info/METADATA stub so importlib.metadata.version() succeeds
when imported directly from the source checkout via sys.path.
